1039 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 284 0 R
/E (Children who come from a cooler climate to a hotter climate, especially during the heatwave season, are at risk. They should be advised not to move out in the open for one week. This helps the body get acclimatized to heat. They should also be advised to drink plenty of water. Acclimatization is achieved by gradual exposure to the hot environment during a heatwave.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [3]
>>
